  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 1602.03 “Full rate case” means a proceeding in which a revenue requirement is established for a utility and rates set to meet that revenue requirement.\n\nSource. #8428, eff 9-10-05 (from Puc 1601.03); ss by #10535, eff 3-4-14 (from Puc 1602.02); ss by #14030, eff 7-25-24 (formerly Puc 1602.02)",
